      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Earth's Moving Shell\n\nThe **lithosphere** includes the crust and uppermost mantle. It rides over the hotter, softer **asthenosphere**, allowing plates to move a few centimeters per year.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
